      "review_description": "I found their follow up on any queries I had to be very good, they took the time to explain the process which I found to be very helpful considering there is so much info out there about solar that it can be quite confusing. The sales person I had the pleasure of dealing with is very professional and courteous which made the experience more pleasant, as a result of this I have and will continue to recommend AAA Trade Power to others that may be looking into solar energy. One thing that usually wins out over others is the price, they were very competitive, no-one even came close and their equipment is the same or similar to what others are using. AAA any day :)",
